                "loc": "JOS.21.1+JOS.21.2+JOS.21.3+JOS.21.4+JOS.21.5+JOS.21.6+JOS.21.7+JOS.21.8+JOS.21.9+JOS.21.10+JOS.21.11+JOS.21.12+JOS.21.13+JOS.21.14+JOS.21.15+JOS.21.16+JOS.21.17+JOS.21.18+JOS.21.19+JOS.21.20+JOS.21.21+JOS.21.22+JOS.21.23+JOS.21.24+JOS.21.25+JOS.21.26+JOS.21.27+JOS.21.28+JOS.21.29+JOS.21.30+JOS.21.31+JOS.21.32+JOS.21.33+JOS.21.34+JOS.21.35+JOS.21.36+JOS.21.37+JOS.21.38+JOS.21.39+JOS.21.40+JOS.21.41+JOS.21.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 21:1-42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA akagambira Musa omu byeya bya Mowabbu haihi n'ekisaaru Yorudaani omunsi Yeriko ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gambira abantu ba Isirairi, hansi yabo ei babagaine, baheho Abaleevi embuga ezi baraikaramu niitaka erizehinguliriize ery'okulisizaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embuga ezi, zibe zaabo z'okwikaramu, kandi niitaka niryo balisizeemuga ente zaabo n'ebisoro ebindi ebitungwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaliisizo ag'embuga aga muraaha Abaleevi, gatandikire ha kisiika eky'orubuga n'okweyongerayo gahike mita bbina nataano embaju zoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi aheeru y'orubuga, ha rubaju orwa Bugwaizooba, naho mulenge mita rwenda balisizemuga, ebisoro byabo kandi bombekemu embuga zaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embuga ezi muraaha Abaleevi, zibe mbuga mukaaga, abantu ezi barairukiramuga, oku nuho mwikirizege omuntu anyakwisire mutaahi we atagenderiire nuho asingirwe, kandi mubongereho embuga makumi ana na ibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embuga zoona ezi muraha Abaleevi, zihike makumi ana na munaana, mubateeriireho n'ezamaliisizo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi embuga ezi murabaha, muziihe ha bantu ba Isirairi, enganda ezirukukiraho obukooto, muziiheho embuga nyingi, kandi enganda nke, muziiheho embuga nke; buli ruganda nirulengererwa ha bwingi bw'itaka eri rwagabaine.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
