            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.20.1+JOS.20.2+JOS.20.3+JOS.20.4+JOS.20.5+JOS.20.6+JOS.20.7+JOS.20.8+JOS.20.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 20:1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi MUKAMA yayongera yagambira Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gambira abantu ba Isirairi ngu: Obu murayambuka ekisaaru Yorudaani mukataaha omunsi Kanaani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahonaaho, mwekomere embuga ezi muraasingirwamuga, omuntu anyakwita mutaahi we habw'obutandwa nuho asingirwege. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embuga ezi, nizo murasingirwamuga, nukwo mutabuke arukwenda kubahoora enzigu, omuntu anyakwisire omuntu mutaahi we, aleke kwitwa atakeemerezibwe omu maiso g'ekitebe okucwerwa omusango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi embuga ezi, ezi mulibaha ziriba mbuga zanyu ez'okusingirwamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embuga isatu ez'obuseeri obw'ekisaaru Yorudaani, n'ezindi isatu ezinyakuli omunsi Kanaani, nizo mulihayo, zibe mbuga ez'okusingirwamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embuga omukaaga ezi, abantu nuho basingirwege ensuuhuki enyakwikara nabo, oku, omuntu aisire mutaahi we h'abw'obutandwa nuho asingirwege. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Baitu kakuba omuntu ateeza mutaahi we ekintu eky'ekyoma, kiteerwa akagwerekerra, kiteera aba mwisi mali, na uwe kimuhikiriire kwitwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi kakuba amuteeza ibaale kiterwa akagwerekerra, kiteera aba mwisi mali na uwe kimuhikiriire kwitwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rundi kakuba amuteeza ekiti akagwerekerra, kiteera nabwo aba mwisi mali na uwe kimuhikiriire kwitwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arukuhorra kiitwa, obu aliitirana kiita, amwite.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu kakuba aba amucumisire habw'enobi, rundi akagira eki amuhunguliire amweserekeriire akamwita, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rundi akamuteera habw'obunyanzigwa akagwa hansi akakabiraho, kiteera na uwe aitwe, mwisi mali arukuhorra kiitwa obu alimwitirana na uwe asemeriire kumwita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Baitu kakuba aba amujumbutukiire akamucumita atamwinaho bunyanzigwa, rundi akagira eki amuhunguliire atabandize kumweserekerra, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rundi amutiize ibale lyamwita, rundi akalimuhungurra atamuboine lyamwita, kandi kunu akaba atali muzigu we, kandi atagenderiire kumukoraho akabi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obu, ekitebe nikyo kicwemuga ebigambo eby'abantu ababiri abo: Kiita, n'arukwenda kuhoorra kiitwa enzigu nikihondera ebiragiro eki bigamba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekitebe kitabule, kiita omuhoozi w'enzigu atakamuhoire, kimugarre omu rubuga rwe ow'okusingirwamu, oru akaba asingirwemu, nuho aikale okuhika nyakatagara omukuru ayaseesirweho amagita agarukwera obu alifa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu omwisi ogu, obu kalimusoha omurundi gumu akaruga omu rubuga orw'okusingirwemu oru yasingirwemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omuhoozi w'enzigu akamuhoorra aheeru yarwo, kimuhoora taliba na musango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba omwisi, kimuhikiriire okwikara omu rubuga orw'owabu orw'okusingirwamu, okuhika nyakatagara omukuru afiire, nyakatagara omukuru obu alimara kufa, nubwo agaruke omu butaka bwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebiragiro ebinyakukwata ha bakaiso n'abacungurwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hoona ha murakabaga ebiro byona, binu biraabaga biragiro ebi muraakuratiraga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.17.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 17:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.19.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omuntu ou araaitaga omuntu mutaahi we, kiita na uwe aitwe, obu haraabahoga baakaiso abarukumurumiriza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekindi, mutaliikiriza kucungura omuntu anyakwisire omuntu omutaahi we, yacwerwa omusango ogwokufa; baitu na uwe aitwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mutaliikiriza kuchungura omusingwa ayasingiirwe omu rubuga rw'owaabu orw'okusingirwamu, nukwo agaruke omu butaka bwe, nyakatagara omukuru atakafiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu mulikora muti, ensi ei murukwikaramu timuligisiisa. Habwokuba esagama niyo esiisa ensi, busaho ekisobora kuleherra ensi enyakuseesirwemu esagama, okwihaho kuseesa esagama y'omuntu ayaseesire esagama omunsi egi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutalisiisa ensi ei mwikaramu, nanyowe ei nyikaramu; habwokuba nyowe MUKAMA, nyikara hagati y'abantu ba Isirairi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
